      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.14.1</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Jump hosts use their own saved password</b>, including one saved in a
      shared login.</li>
  <li><b>Saved passwords no longer disappear</b> when several panes reconnect
      at once.</li>
  <li><b>Press Return to reconnect</b> a session that has ended.</li>
  <li><b>Fixed:</b> a red dot on a connected server, and the host editor
      sitting to the right of its window.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
